Verifies that mmap and mlock together performs pre-allocation of PTEs and makes the allocated memory resident.

Test inputs:
    This test use mmap() to allocate 1MiB of memory and makes it resident using mlock().
    It then reads the file /proc/$pid/smaps, finds the mapping for the memory allocation
    and compare the value of Rss and Locked with the allocation size.
    ./test_mmra_resident_memory

Expected result:
    SUCCESS: requested 1024 KiB, pre-allocated 1024 KiB, locked 1024 KiB

Results location:
    output.txt.
